ilability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2025-04-03\nValid as Of: 2025-04-06\nVersion: 2502\n\n--- Record 1099 ---\nComponent: Event Mesh\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Event Mesh Bridge\nDescription: Create a bridge between Event Mesh in SAP Integration Suite and SAP Integration Suite, advanced event mesh. See Event Mesh Bridge.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2025-04-06\nValid as Of: 2025-04-06\nVersion: 2502\n\n--- Record 1100 ---\nComponent: Event Mesh\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Test Messaging\nDescription: Test messaging on queues and topics you've created in Event Mesh capability. See Test Messaging.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2025-04-06\nValid as Of: 2025-04-06\nVersion: 2502\n\n", "--- Record 1571 ---\nComponent: SAP Build Work Zone, standard edition\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Tracking Imports in the Transport Manager\nDescription: A new screen has been added to the Site Manager – the Transport Manager.   Administrators can use the Transport Manager, accessed from the side panel, to track the progress of an import process. As a result, this process no longer takes control of the Site Manager, allowing administrators to continue working during the import. \nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2025-01-23\nValid as Of: 2025-01-23\nVersion: 2413B\n\n--- Record 1572 ---\nComponent: SAP Java Buildpack\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Version 1.109.0\nDescription: SAP Java Buildpack 1 has been updated from version 1.107.0 to 1.109.0. Updated components:      Apache Tomcat 9 is updated from version 9.0.96 to 9.0.98      Apache TomEE 7 is updated from version 7.0.9.sap-46 to 7.0.9.sap-49      SAP HANA Driver (hana.driver.2.X.X) is updated from version 2.22.12 to 2.23.7      otel-ag